{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：工业富联二季度业绩符合指引</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>研报最值得看的判断，不是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>，而是藏在分部数据里的结构性信号：上半年云计算业务收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">76%</span>，其中CSP客户的AI服务器收入同比增长超过<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.3倍</span>，GPU AI机架出货量增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.2倍</span>，ASIC AI机架出货量增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3倍</span>。这些数字放在一起，说明工业富联的增长引擎已经从代工组装切换到AI基础设施的规模交付。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>收入<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3070亿元</span>人民币，环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>，比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预期高<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6%</span>，与市场一致预期基本持平。毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.0%</span>，环比下降0.4个百分点，同比上升0.5个百分点，低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>和市场预期约0.5个百分点。经营利润172亿元，环比增长21%，同比增长101%，高于Citi预期5%、高于市场预期8%。净利润131亿元，落在七月指引的中值区间。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看收入与利润的组合。收入<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>但毛利率<span style=\"color:#B26B00;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">低于预期</span>，经营利润又明显好于预期，这三件事同时发生，指向一个解释：高毛利的AI服务器和网络设备占比在提升，但整体毛利率被代工模式的结构性特征压住。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在报告里也提到，云计算收入低于其预期，可能源于更高的寄售模式占比——寄售模式下收入确认口径更大，但毛利率更薄。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWKF5ibDOfLibQbanPFF9guyQQzM5q8VmTPOA3iaephvQiaLjnBeSa7mRlr2yEhRZBWROCgCuzBVPZOx1QYF9XyFft1m6Iibv6uaJnw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">1. 上半年AI服务器收入同比增长超过两倍</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">分业务拆开看，上半年云计算收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">76%</span>，低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">89%</span>。差异主要来自产品组合：CSP客户的AI服务器收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.3倍</span>以上，GPU AI机架出货量增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.2倍</span>，ASIC AI机架出货量增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3倍</span>，ASIC CPU服务器出货量增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.5倍</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">数据中心高速网络收入同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1倍</span>，800G以上交换机出货量增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.4倍</span>，SuperNIC出货量增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1.4倍</span>。网络设备与AI服务器同步放量，说明工业富联在AI集群里拿到的不是单一机柜订单，而是从计算到交换的整套交付。</p>\n<blockquote style=\"margin:16px 0;padding:10px 14px;border-left:3px solid #AAB4C3;background:#F7F8FA;color:#4B5565;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\">简单说，出货量翻三倍意味着产线切换已经完成，不是停留在样品阶段；我更关注的是下半年这组增速能否维持，因为基数抬高后同比数字会自然回落。</blockquote>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVh3BlcYWLicT0Sak9qr3Zjq8D7D4jHjAITicXoTzd6Oa1BoZIiaeGw9iaCIxXjmibX12B2iaLry5H9jDu75JKRozoM1Yl9WwbIeCRlI/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. 毛利率环比下降但同比上升，代工模式的结构性特征仍在</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>毛利率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.0%</span>，环比下降0.4个百分点，同比上升0.5个百分点。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>认为服务器业务毛利率在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.5%</span>到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.5%</span>之间，估值模型里给的是<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.2%</span>。这个区间本身说明，AI服务器代工的毛利率天花板并不高，规模是主要杠杆。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">经营利润率同比提升1.3个百分点，环比持平。收入环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">22%</span>而经营利润率没有摊薄，说明费用控制有效，规模效应在经营利润层面体现得比毛利率层面更明显。净利润率约<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.3%</span>，同比<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">改善</span>约1个百分点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">把毛利率和经营利润率放在一起看，工业富联的利润弹性主要来自经营杠杆，而非单台产品的毛利<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>。这与市场对AI硬件公司的一般预期不同——很多人以为AI服务器毛利更高，实际上代工模式下，利润增长更多靠周转和规模。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUZyWelUaE41EBES14DVxPNQbnsMW77ndYUSV7aAQFepOFC9UmLe7dyd8r2O3k6xZABYZ1OSyStoSCKkPPtzN0XT8AdEJicfDNw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">3. <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>维持<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027年</span>净利润预测不变</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>维持<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2026</span>年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">620亿元</span>、<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2027</span>年<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">890亿元</span>的净利润预测。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVfbRtdprIJNiaq0wF02ea4FoI8CK6tTprKYNJlOLlbgW5NlXvibdE42h9KkQ8L3Qic6wnRiaWQH9aXJIXibAiaomqbibnB1BSdN224Wc/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 16-CITI-Foxconn Industrial Internet -601138- 2Q26 Results In-line with Guidance-260811</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
